name: sim.handleModule
description: 
luaSynopsis: (1) int result=sim.handleModule(int sim.handle_all,bool calledInSensingPart)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. sim.handle_all: indicates that all plugins should be handled (called)
2. moduleName: the name of the plugin that should be handled (called)
3. calledInSensingPart: set to false when called in the "actuation part". Set to true when called in the "sensing part"
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. result: number of plugins that executed the command.
